{# Bestellung an das Weingut (englisch). Kontext: anrede, bestellnummer, kundenbestellnummer, kunde,
   lieferant, gesamtmenge, positionen, liefertag, shipment, spedition, anhang_name, hinweis, gruss, signatur #}
<p>{{ anrede }}</p>
<p>please find attached our new order{% if bestellnummer %} <b>{{ bestellnummer }}</b>{% endif %} for <b>{{ kunde }}</b>{% if kundenbestellnummer %} (customer order no. {{ kundenbestellnummer }}){% endif %}: {{ gesamtmenge | menge_de }} bottles in {{ positionen | length }} item{% if positionen | length != 1 %}s{% endif %}.
{% if liefertag %}
The goods are due at the customer on <b>{{ liefertag | datum_de }}</b> (fixed delivery date){% if spedition %}; transport will be arranged by {{ spedition }}{% endif %}.
{% elif shipment %}
Shipment: {{ shipment }}{% if spedition %} via {{ spedition }}{% endif %}.
{% elif spedition %}
Transport will be arranged by {{ spedition }}.
{% endif %}
</p>
<p>Kindly confirm receipt of the order and let us know the loading date.</p>
{% if hinweis %}
<p>{{ hinweis | nl2br }}</p>
{% endif %}
<p>{{ gruss }}</p>
{{ signatur }}
